<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-KOGER &amp; SUMBERG CONSTRUCTION TO ISSUE SHARES.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-KOGER &amp; SUMBERG CONSTRUCTION TO ISSUE SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Koger &amp; Sumberg, one of Estonia's leading construction companies, plans a share issue ahead of applying for a bourse listing.</p>
<p>Koger &amp; Sumberg board member Margus Kaasik told Reuters that the company has approved the share issue and its amount, but refused to provide any details before an official statement.</p>
<p>Kaasik added the company will soon make an official statement.</p>
<p>Koger &amp; Sumberg's present share capital is 11.5 mln kroons.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
